{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mushroom Survivors</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>roguelike survival game</strong> where you battle hordes of deadly mushroom monsters using auto-casting magical attacks. Move strategically, collect magical upgrades, and survive the apocalypse one minute at a time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as one of the last remaining humans in a cursed world overrun by monstrous fungi. Unlock new heroes, harness different magical abilities, and fight your way through toxic forests, eerie ruins, and mysterious islands.<br><br>Story :<br>In a world overrun by a deadly mushroom plague, nearly all of humanity has perished only a few with rare immunity remain. But the infection did more than just kill... it transformed. From the ruins of civilization, monstrous mushroom creatures have emerged some mindless, others terrifyingly intelligent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These mushroom demons have formed clans, grouped by their eerie colors, and now roam the land capturing the last survivors. Yet, amidst the chaos, a forgotten power lingers\u00a0<strong>magic</strong>. Ancient spellbooks still hold power, giving those who find them a fighting chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the immune one of the last hopes. Survive the nightmare, harness magical powers, and embark on a mission to rescue the remaining humans before they vanish forever into the spores.<br><br>\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude93 <strong>Auto-attacking weapons</strong> and unlockable skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Level up</strong> to choose random upgrades in every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>25 minutes per match</strong> survival challenge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Face hordes of enemies, powerful elite monsters, and final bosses</p></li><li><p 